{"scope":"knowledge/storyboard","page":4,"pageSize":24,"total":143,"totalPages":6,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ade877195651","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"视觉设定阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/视觉设定.md` 中的人物/造型、地点/视图、道具/状态、声音身份与跨场连续性。 它继承剧本事实，不决定镜头瞬态、构图、动作终点或生成提示词。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ae68703b68c4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"动作的可生成性","description":"1. 什么时候适用 2. 判据：这个动作在日常影像里常见吗 3. 四类高风险写法 4. 戏剧信息从哪里来 5. 改写方法 6. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/generability.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aea74ab07c2d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"场次视觉戏剧计划","description":"场次视觉计划是正式分镜前的可选思考层，回答整场怎样改变观众位置、空间压力、观看节奏和声音注意。 它不是第二份剧本，也不拥有镜头边界。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/scene-visual-plan.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-af0c3fa86664","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"台词技法（dialogue craft）——治「台词功底差 / 像 AI」","description":"> 写 `script.md` 的对白、抽 `lines.json` 前必读。目标：台词像\"偷听到的人话\"，不像\"AI 在互相念说明书\"。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/dialogue-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-afb8e6c21834","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"镜头修订与稳定身份","description":"镜头 ID 表示同一个编辑/导演决定的连续身份，不等于列表位置，也不等于外部制作任务编号。 修订时先判断镜头的叙事职责是否仍是同一个，再决定保留、创建或 retire。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/shot-revision-identity.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b19a64c5f925","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Look Development：把视觉方向变成可比较的代表帧","description":"Look development 不是给全剧粘一个风格标签，也不是让参考图接管角色和剧情。它把创作者 接受的 `visual_direction` / `production_profile` 投影成少量**文本风格帧规格**，让人物、地点与 高压力场景在正式分镜前共用一套可观察视觉语言。本阶段只产出规格和提示词；创作者要求 实际出图时交给 `$short-drama-produce`，并对它展示的精确任务预览明确确认。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/look-development.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b3047a4b0ebd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧故事开发方法","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 从题材词到戏剧承诺 3. 设计能持续运转的冲突引擎 4. 让人物成为压力的制造者 5. 用状态变化判断升级 6. 管理信息、证据与兑现 7. 让主题进入选择 8. 生成真正不同的方案 9. 从引擎走向分集 10. 合成示例 11. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/story-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b491f2bb1b88","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"去标识 Promotion Ledger","description":"Promotion ledger 记录“哪项公共规则为什么被晋升、缩窄、暂缓或退休”，让维护者能复核 匿名评测、定位准确公共 diff 并回滚。它不是私有证据摘要，也不是排行榜。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/promotion-ledger.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b6632de7b28f","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"入驻与账号","description":"来源：操作手册 https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a053db7186bcf04b44c0222 （2026-08-13 13:30）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/onboard.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b880c5d4bd11","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"因果节拍法（causal beats）——让剧情「有逻辑地上头」，不是流水账","description":"> 剧情简单/散，多半是「然后…然后…」的流水账。好剧本是**因果链**：每个节拍都由上一个 > **导致**，主角的选择推动下一步。本文给单集的因果节拍模板 + 爽点密度要求，配合 > `genre-hooks-handbook.md`（选题材/钩子）与 `four-act-drama.md`（四幕结构）使用。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/causal-beats.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b9c45958674c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"视频提示词审查量表与合成案例","description":"1. 审查顺序 2. 证据量表 3. 完成前结构检查 4. 合成正例 5. 合成反例","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ba869b3010dd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"契约与所有权","description":"```text 开发? -> 剧本 -> 视觉设定 -> 图片提示词 \\-> 分镜 -> 视频提示词 \\-> 明确确认后的媒体生产 ```","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/contract-and-ownership.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-bb5e2f6076f8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Story And Script Rubric","description":"audience payoff without relying on a genre label? misunderstanding, humiliation, rescue, or reveal?","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-story-script.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-bfe5501f07b8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Creator-first 工作流","description":"每集按需维护五份创作者可读 Markdown：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/creator-workflow.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c1e9fbad3e30","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Scoped Edit 与自然语言修订","description":"每次 edit 都声明精确目标/区域、要改什么、必须保留什么，以及预期的连续性影响。如果期望变更会 改写身份或已确认上游事实，路由给该 owner，不要伪装成局部提示词修订。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/edit-and-revision.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c490f037c1c9","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"项目级试跑与生产反馈校准","description":"校准只消费创作者提供或授权形成的**文字观察记录**，用来改进当前项目的提示词与镜头设计。 本技能不提交任务、不下载或生成媒体，也不从“任务成功”、结果地址或文件存在推断内容质量。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/project-calibration.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c5ca39c36eaa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"道具 Plate：尺度、功能、状态与文字","description":"道具 Plate 保持尺度、形状、材质、磨损、功能/活动部件与 accepted text policy。 它应展示当前 State，但不能悄悄重新设计底层 prop identity。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/prop-plate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c7eb7a3f0823","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Adapter Contract","description":"```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"job_id\": \"EP001-MOTION001-video\", \"modality\": \"video\", \"adapter\": \"studio-video\", \"prompt\": \"the exact copyable prompt from MOTION-EP001-001\", \"source\": \"剧集/EP001/视频提示词.md\", \"source_entry\": \"MOTION-EP001…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-produce/references/adapter-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-produce","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c95fe71dad72","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"前提装置：把外来优势写成有边界的压力","description":"前提装置是叠加在题材之上的一个开局设定：主角比处境中的其他人**多拥有一样东西**—— 一段已经发生过的记忆，或一套外部授权的能力。装置本身不提供冲突，它**取消**冲突； 所以它带来的全部工艺问题都是同一个：把取消掉的阻力用什么补回来。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/premise-devices.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-caa369807012","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"生产参考板决策：角色、场景与道具","description":"来自对角色、场景、物品资产如何进入后续镜头的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。 通用方法见 [common-recipe.md](common-recipe.md)；本文档提供可按项目调整的生产版式。 核心原则：**先明确资产负责的稳定身份与当前版本，再让分镜负责本镜呈现**。纯白底、 无情绪、三视图只是便于识别的一种项目选择；带环境的背景、单视图或带状态的参考板 只要更符合复用目的且不混淆身份与临时状态，也可以由创作者选择（IMG-03/IMG-04）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/production-sheet-recipes.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-cc316354f84b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧分集与单集设计","description":"1. 分集的工作定义 2. 规则分级 3. 单集契约 4. 钩子、兑现与出去的压力 5. 因果节拍与升级链 6. 场景化之前的可见性检查 7. 系列弧线与分集地图 8. 集间状态交接 9. 扩写、压缩与重排 10. 合成示例 11. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/episode-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-cfdc77d619e2","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"开篇黄金法则","description":"微短剧观众的注意力窗口极短。如果前5秒没有抓住他们，手指一划就流失了。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/opening-rules.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-d00bbad02454","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"去模板感：诊断、修订与误报","description":"“像模板”不是稳定 finding。先定位重复机制如何伤害当前故事，再把修订交给 owner。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/anti-template-repair.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-d1b10961ec94","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"企业主体认证","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed419cdee5b04e989024c （2026-08-13 13:37）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/verify.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}}]}
